Saving replaces the stored plant. Other plants stay as they are.                                                        
                                                                                                                        
+--------------------+ #===============================================================================================#
| > 1 General        | | General                                                                                       |
|   2 Care           | |                                                                                               |
|   3 Extra (closed) | |          #==================================================================================# |
+--------------------+ | > name   | basil_                                                                           | |
                       |          #==================================================================================# |
                       |          A short name of the plant.                                                           |
                       |          +----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+ |
                       |   kind   | herb                                                                           v | |
                       |          +----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+ |
                       |          +----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+ |
                       |   origin | greenhouse (set by the nursery)                                                  | |
                       |          +----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+ |
                       #===============================================================================================#
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
[ F2 save ]  [ esc cancel ]  [ ctrl+r reload ]                                                                          
